<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Ocean in j/v with Trans Hex.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Ocean in j/v with Trans Hex.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diamond explorer Ocean Resources NL announced on Monday the formation of a joint venture with South African producer Trans Hex International for its Indonesian Sunda Shelf offshore diamond project.</p>
<p>Trans Hex International would invest US$5.0 million for a 30 percent stake in the project, Ocean said in a statement.</p>
<p>The company also would secure finance to take the project into production and would manage the project, it said. Ocean would retain 42 percent of the project with Toronto-based Indomin Resources Ltd holding the remainder.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
